{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06273","headline":"孟门行 · 崔颢","name":"孟门行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄雀衔黄花，翩翩傍檐隙。\n本拟报君恩，如何反弹射。\n金罍美酒满座春，平原爱才多衆宾。\n满堂尽是忠义士，何意得有谗谀人。\n谀言反覆那可道，能令君心不自保。\n北园新栽桃李枝，根株未固何转移。\n成阴结实君自取，若问傍人那得知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06273.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06273","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}